Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.34,0:00:15.75,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,让我住下
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.44,0:00:18.29,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可以是可以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.89,0:00:25.92,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,在上次的爆料猜谜节目之后
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.46,0:00:31.09,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,地址被粉丝和黑子两边都人肉搜索出来 住不下去了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.61,0:00:35.48,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,因此神奈大小姐只能暂住在我家
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.97,0:02:18.24,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你已经在我家待一周了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.24,0:02:19.61,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.00,0:02:23.08,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,虽说可以是可以…
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.08,0:02:24.21,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.21,0:02:26.70,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你还是别看手机了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.70,0:02:28.67,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,反正肯定没写啥好话吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.67,0:02:30.96,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,是没错 但我就是网络依赖症啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.96,0:02:32.54,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你还自己承认了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.93,0:02:37.51,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我就是想从那99句坏话里找出唯一的好话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.51,0:02:39.38,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我想找到依靠啊
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.85,0:02:42.93,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,哇 还真是依赖症
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.93,0:02:45.10,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你就不会在意吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.10,0:02:47.40,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那些坏话是很让人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.40,0:02:49.66,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但又不会造成什么实际伤害
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.66,0:02:52.03,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,反正我的人生也不会和那些人产生什么交集
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.03,0:02:55.20,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,哇啊 你这样的反而不适合当主播
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.20,0:02:56.57,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可能是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.50,0:02:59.91,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,本来舞由才是我们的主角
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.91,0:03:02.61,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,毕竟舞由的粉丝很多呢
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.61,0:03:03.62,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,对对
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.28,0:03:06.08,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,圭姐那边有发来联络吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.08,0:03:07.00,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,没
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.00,0:03:08.40,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,真令人担心
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.40,0:03:10.20,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,据说她们公司都被闹得一团糟了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.20,0:03:13.68,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,要是也顺便把那个VR设备毁掉就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.68,0:03:17.34,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那样就会有那个邪神力量冒出来搞什么改写现实之类的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.34,0:03:19.55,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,真让人不爽
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.32,0:03:24.52,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我只是想逃开那些可怕的事 过上开心的生活而已
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.24,0:03:30.46,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,还有人说什么应该直面问题 根本就不是一回事
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.46,0:03:31.87,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,他以为自己是什么正义超人吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.87,0:03:34.95,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,所以都说别去在意别人的话了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.27,0:03:37.70,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我可以帮你哦
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.70,0:03:38.70,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,帮什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.70,0:03:40.95,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,帮你一起复活舞由
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.70,0:03:44.08,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,反正我要那个什么点数也没用
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.08,0:03:46.00,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,真的吗 太谢谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:50.25,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,只要让那个叫什么克苏鲁的章鱼女滚蛋就行了对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.25,0:03:53.44,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,虽然说是要十亿点数才有办法做到
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.44,0:03:55.40,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,光听着就让人窒息了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.40,0:03:57.17,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你现在有多少点数了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.17,0:03:58.17,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,五百万
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:03:59.62,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我也就七百万
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.84,0:04:04.85,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,下一场是第四场游戏\N再下一场就是最后的决战
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.85,0:04:06.43,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你觉得我们能攒够吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.43,0:04:08.02,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我会让它攒出来的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.02,0:04:09.31,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,不管用什么手段
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.17,0:04:14.73,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你买了什么吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.73,0:04:15.76,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,没有啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:18.49,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,该不会是这里也被人肉出来了…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.04,0:04:22.15,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,是我
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.15,0:04:23.86,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,佐野清次郎
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.12,0:04:29.12,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,你好
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.83,0:04:32.37,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,正太萝莉控
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:35.54,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我跟你说过要和我保持一米以上的距离吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.54,0:04:37.30,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,哎呀 不好意思
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.64,0:04:40.01,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,真是找了你们好久啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.59,0:04:43.96,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,找什么找啊 你这跟踪狂
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.96,0:04:45.85,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这个住址我可是没告诉任何人的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.85,0:04:48.74,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,不 虽然我觉得灵子是没什么好担心的
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:53.01,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,但是听说神奈失踪了\N我就猜测可能是在灵子家
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.65,0:04:57.91,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,现在社会上对你父亲的医院的舆论攻击好像相当厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.91,0:04:59.46,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,没问题吗
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.46,0:05:00.72,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,没什么
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.72,0:05:02.18,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,反正肯定会被他压下来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.18,0:05:05.12,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,但要是能让那个家里稍微吃点苦头倒是好的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.12,0:05:08.46,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,如果这能让你的心情平复一些就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.46,0:05:10.94,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,清次郎老师真是个好人呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.94,0:05:12.66,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,虽然是个正太萝莉控
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.66,0:05:14.58,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.00,0:05:16.70,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你自己那边没事吗
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.70,0:05:18.60,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我已经辞职不做教师了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.39,0:05:21.63,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,因为不想给周围造成麻烦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.93,0:05:25.49,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,至于我的家人…我让他们先到别处避难了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.27,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,没问题的 我已经得到家里人的理解了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.43,0:05:32.39,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,那我就先走了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.71,0:05:34.47,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你现在的住所怎么办呢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.47,0:05:38.59,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,我现在搬到了便宜的商务酒店暂住
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.59,0:05:43.86,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,要不我也稍微存些点数 让祂们帮我把生活恢复原状好了？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.11,0:05:46.37,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我也同意这个用法
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.37,0:05:48.02,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.02,0:05:52.11,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,无论如何 这场游戏只剩两局就要结束了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.11,0:05:53.33,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,对了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.21,0:05:55.70,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,瑛太君他
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.70,0:05:57.88,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,好像失踪了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.84,0:06:12.39,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,你真准时呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.54,0:06:15.49,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,天丛圭小姐
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.20,0:06:18.95,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,你真的是格亚…小姐吗
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.95,0:06:19.89,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,没有错
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.89,0:06:23.81,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,这个状态…就姑且称之为有实际质量的灵体吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.81,0:06:24.57,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:29.28,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,长话短说的话 就是我使用了一日复活券
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.68,0:06:35.44,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,好不容易攒到这么多点数的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.44,0:06:38.03,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,休一个放松假也是很有必要的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.03,0:06:40.71,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,喔 原来还可以这样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.71,0:06:43.88,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,你们不管做什么都是点数制呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.88,0:06:46.63,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,没错 无论何时都能让人笑容满面的点数支付
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.97,0:06:49.46,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,各位邪神之间的价值观是不同的
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.46,0:06:51.97,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,这样交易才没有后顾之忧吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.97,0:06:54.18,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,这个我就不是很懂了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.18,0:06:55.82,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,好了 我们走吧
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.82,0:06:57.94,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,可不能让这24小时白白浪费呢
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.33,0:07:00.57,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那个 要去哪里？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.57,0:07:03.40,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,当然是去京都进行美食之旅了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.40,0:07:07.86,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,就是因为这个才叫上你这个腐女兼历史厨
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.21,0:07:10.07,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,邪神居然搞什么美食旅行？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.07,0:07:11.88,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,明明是侵略者？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.88,0:07:13.96,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,这算什么 怎么会有这种事？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.27,0:07:18.95,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,让我来告诉你个小知识
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.25,0:07:24.93,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,虽然大家都叫我格亚 格亚的\N其实我本名是克图格亚
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.93,0:07:26.08,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.08,0:07:29.84,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,因为被说和克苏鲁撞名字了 容易念混什么的
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.84,0:07:33.47,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,实在没办法 所以在演播室的时候只能自称格亚了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.78,0:07:36.43,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那还是很麻烦呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.43,0:07:39.73,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,虽然对宇宙规模的我们来说是微不足道的事
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.73,0:07:43.90,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,但是既然缩到了日本的大小 也就相应地变得促狭了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.17,0:07:46.36,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,好啦 我们快开始吃吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.36,0:07:48.53,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,对了 不用担心钱的问题哦
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.53,0:07:51.15,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我提前准备好了有一亿存款的银行账户
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.15,0:07:52.51,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那是作弊吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.51,0:07:54.71,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,真是个爱计较细节的孩子呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.71,0:07:56.25,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,你也试着以宇宙规模为前提思考一下吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.25,0:07:58.56,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,宇宙规模什么的先不提
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.56,0:08:01.25,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那个 既然能够与我们这样交流的话
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.56,0:08:04.91,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,不能通过谈话让你们放弃侵略吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.95,0:08:08.77,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,那种谈话是行不通的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.77,0:08:11.34,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,归根结底 人类对我们来说…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.19,0:08:14.81,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,根本就不是对等的存在
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.12,0:08:21.76,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,倘若脚边的蚂蚁跟你说「想和你以对等的地位进行会谈」
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.76,0:08:23.76,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,你会听吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.62,0:08:36.69,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,真引人注目
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.93,0:08:41.04,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,就把这当作是漫展吧
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:43.36,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,还真是在奇怪的地方显得很熟悉
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.36,0:08:45.25,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那个 毕竟这里是神社…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.25,0:08:49.39,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,不过 现在也不会像以前那样被当作怪人看待了…
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.66,0:08:52.13,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,茄子
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.53,Default,Foreigner,0,0,0,,多谢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.05,0:08:56.53,Ruby,Foreigner,0,0,0,,Thank you so much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:57.77,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,请随时来玩！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.53,0:08:57.77,Ruby,Cthugha,0,0,0,,Any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.77,0:09:00.94,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,你看吧 被人家当做日本动画的角色了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.94,0:09:03.20,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我这可是为Cool Japan做贡献了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.20,0:09:06.87,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,这套近乎的方法还真是惹人厌 明明是个侵略者
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.71,0:09:16.83,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,好吃吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.83,0:09:17.83,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.83,0:09:20.55,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,不愧是美食导航4.2分
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.55,0:09:21.89,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.89,0:09:24.17,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我一直想和人一起来吃吃这个
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.17,0:09:28.59,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我这身体寻求着美食呢\N毕竟原先是个美食系主播嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.59,0:09:30.38,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,这算是怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.38,0:09:35.43,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那个美食主播本人 是在医院沉睡着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.43,0:09:37.68,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,因为处于原因不明的昏迷状态
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.68,0:09:39.50,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,现在是这样呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.50,0:09:40.60,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,真可怜呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:41.85,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,是这样吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.85,0:09:44.10,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,所以说如果你脚边的微尘...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:45.86,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那个话题已经够了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.74,0:09:49.95,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,也想让其他几位尝尝看这个呢
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.95,0:09:51.57,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,其他几位是？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.57,0:09:54.07,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,我没跟你说过吗
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.93,0:10:01.12,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,舞由…？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.12,0:10:02.66,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.66,0:10:05.08,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余的美貌让你看呆了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.08,0:10:06.51,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这个嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.51,0:10:08.51,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,因为实在是太突然了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.42,0:10:13.01,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,为什么你会出现在这里啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.03,0:10:25.69,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,到底怎么回事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.69,0:10:28.62,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,那家伙要来侵略这边的世界了吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.62,0:10:29.73,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.73,0:10:32.65,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,章鱼在想什么东西我完全搞不懂
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.65,0:10:36.07,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真是热闹的城市啊 虽然很小
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.07,0:10:38.12,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,真是不好意思啊 公主大人
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.12,0:10:40.05,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,让我回想起拉莱耶了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.05,0:10:43.12,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那边也有很多偶像的商品在卖…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.12,0:10:45.12,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,应该说是在被祭祀着吧
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.12,0:10:48.28,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,纪元前的古代都市到底是个什么情况
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.28,0:10:50.18,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,难道说其实很亲民吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:51.39,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,鬼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.40,0:10:53.92,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,好吃好吃
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.92,0:10:55.33,Default,Both,0,0,0,,同类相食？！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.33,0:10:56.76,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,来来 这是你的份
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.76,0:10:59.03,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,啊 好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.27,0:11:02.56,Default,Mayu,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,482)}好吃吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.85,0:11:03.90,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.90,0:11:06.56,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这家伙只是盗用了舞由的身体而已
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.56,0:11:07.94,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,你也有
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.94,0:11:10.19,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,别用那只触手递给我！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.19,0:11:11.19,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,不要被人发现了！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.44,0:11:16.20,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,确实这具灵体是没有战斗力的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.20,0:11:17.82,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,必须不引人注目才行
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.07,0:11:21.58,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我说啊 有质量的灵体是什么意思？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.58,0:11:23.04,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,鬼知道
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.46,0:11:30.17,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这种东西在姆帝国可见不到
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.17,0:11:31.66,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,好可爱！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.66,0:11:32.88,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,不对 她是敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.98,0:11:48.24,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,很好很好
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.24,0:11:50.73,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余无论穿什么都很合适
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.73,0:11:54.23,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,什么合不合适的 这本来就是人类的身体吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.23,0:11:55.99,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,诶呀 确实是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.99,0:11:58.61,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,看来余已经充分适应这具身体
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.61,0:12:00.32,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,都有些爱不释手了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.57,0:12:01.91,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,那可让人头痛了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.91,0:12:04.16,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真是的 别说这种话啊 人类
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:07.29,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,果然有肉身是好事啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.29,0:12:11.38,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真想早点在现世复活 蹂躪这片大地啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.38,0:12:14.50,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,不是 就算你向我们征求意见也…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.50,0:12:19.37,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,为此 要带给你们更多更多的绝望才行啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.37,0:12:20.68,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你还真是相当乱来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.18,0:12:24.79,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,今天不用讲什么身份礼节
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.79,0:12:27.73,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,我就来玩玩你们人类的下等游戏吧
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.73,0:12:29.48,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这家伙 尽小看我！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.36,0:12:36.09,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,太狡猾了 章鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.09,0:12:39.05,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余才不是章鱼  是伟大的克苏鲁！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.05,0:12:40.32,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,可恶！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.79,0:12:47.75,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这具灵体的体力不够用啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.75,0:12:50.46,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,太好了…是我赢了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:53.23,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,谁赢都无所谓啦
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.23,0:12:59.13,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这啥啊？好羞人！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.13,0:13:02.51,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,我也好久没拍这个 有点兴奋过头了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.88,0:13:06.53,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,虽然伊斯之伟大种族拥有诸多发明
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.53,0:13:09.00,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,但其中并没有这种机器
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.00,0:13:11.65,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,因为他们并没有玩乐之心
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.77,0:13:15.23,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这个国家真有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.69,0:13:17.94,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,你这家伙到底是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.94,0:13:21.44,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,明明说是邪神啊侵略者什么的 也太可爱了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.44,0:13:23.20,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,因为余就是余喵
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:25.95,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这 这家伙堕落得越来越深了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.95,0:13:27.99,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这样总有一天可以打倒她吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.99,0:13:29.20,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那是不可能的
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.71,0:13:32.83,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,所以呢 关于一日复活券的事我已经知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.83,0:13:34.79,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,但你来这里的真实目的到底是什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.23,0:13:43.97,Default,Instruction,0,0,0,,综上所述 今后商业场景的宏大设计
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.97,0:13:49.85,Default,Instruction,0,0,0,,会以可持续的有界风险对冲解决方案的授权为重
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.19,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.19,0:13:57.39,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,就算是依然如故的旧日支配者\N今后也需要拥抱激烈的多样性
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.39,0:13:59.07,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,这是有用的知识
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:01.53,Default,Instruction,0,0,0,,那个 你的那张脸是…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.53,0:14:05.49,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,啊 在这里维持这副打扮很失礼对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.45,0:14:12.41,Default,Instruction,0,0,0,,好帅啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.92,0:14:16.19,Default,Ghatanothoa,0,0,0,,失礼了 请继续你的讲学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.92,0:14:24.13,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,全算在我身上！ 喝吧喝吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.40,0:14:25.76,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,这人谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.76,0:14:28.76,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,好像是个很厉害的直播节目的大人物哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.76,0:14:31.00,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,你会看视频吧 视频
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.00,0:14:32.77,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,现在已经没人看电视了哦
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.77,0:14:33.85,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,也是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.85,0:14:34.75,Default,Zhar,0,0,0,,你们啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.75,0:14:35.90,Default,Lloigor,0,0,0,,没看那个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.90,0:14:36.90,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,「那个」是？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.90,0:14:40.52,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,宇宙恐怖秀啦！ 恐怖秀！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.03,0:14:43.69,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:48.12,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,糟了 没人看过吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.12,0:14:50.12,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,啊 我好像看过！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.12,0:14:53.13,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,就是主播趁着竞猜节目互喷的那个吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.13,0:14:55.39,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,还上了新闻的那个对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:57.04,Default,Hosts,0,0,0,,我还在想那是真是假呢
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.04,0:14:59.55,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,这不是有识货的人嘛！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.55,0:15:01.47,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,对对 就是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.47,0:15:03.66,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,这是我负责策划和制作的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.66,0:15:06.05,Default,Host,0,0,0,,诶 诶…好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.05,0:15:09.18,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,没错 我今天是为了做市场调查才来的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.18,0:15:11.81,Default,Host,0,0,0,,就是那个 恐怖秀很厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.81,0:15:14.14,Default,Host,0,0,0,,我迫不及待想看下一集了！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.14,0:15:16.02,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,对吧？ 对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.02,0:15:18.77,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,多点点喜欢和关注啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.77,0:15:22.45,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,好 多开点香槟吧——
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:25.11,Default,Zhar,0,0,0,,这些人…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.11,0:15:26.68,Default,Lloigor,0,0,0,,根本没看吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.01,0:15:34.70,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真可爱啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.08,0:15:37.53,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,不愧是余选中的母体
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.90,0:15:39.17,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你满足了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.67,0:15:41.13,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,把人当成傻子耍
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.50,0:15:42.58,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.96,0:15:45.72,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,就是因为你 舞由才会在这里沉睡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.72,0:15:47.97,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你明明知道 为什么还要特意来看她？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.47,0:15:51.22,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,可以称之为好奇心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.56,0:15:53.93,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,黒廼灵子
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.93,0:15:58.68,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,你似乎和其他人类不同 身上有种异样的坚强
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.68,0:16:01.36,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,到现在连理智都没怎么减少
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:04.48,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,而你的那份力量来源于外物
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.48,0:16:09.62,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,来源于你比起自己的身体与灵魂来都更加重视的东西
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.49,0:16:13.58,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那就是 这个女孩对吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.99,0:16:18.05,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,因此微不足道的你才能如此挺身与余直面
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.05,0:16:19.95,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,真有意思啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.00,0:16:27.46,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,月光会给予恶魔力量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.46,0:16:32.43,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余等不及用真正的肉体尽情沐浴在月光下了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:34.31,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你从刚才开始怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.31,0:16:37.56,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,已经满足了吧？ 赶快回到VR里去
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.94,0:16:39.06,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,黒廼灵子哟
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.63,0:16:40.51,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,干嘛啦？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.27,0:16:47.28,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这具临时的躯体 以及你珍视的真梦坂舞由的灵魂
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.03,0:16:51.24,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,向余诉说着「想和你在一起」
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.70,0:16:56.85,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这种事情 即使在我作为邪神生活的数万年来
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.85,0:16:58.33,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,也是第一次遇到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.08,0:17:01.17,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,现在余正为此疑惑
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:05.43,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,这是真梦坂舞由的心意…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.43,0:17:07.00,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,还是余的心意呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.46,0:17:08.71,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这种事就算问我…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.60,0:17:20.19,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你想干什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.19,0:17:21.94,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,很好 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.94,0:17:25.11,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,说不定再不用多久就不需要区分这两者了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.11,0:17:28.74,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,而且 我也从你的灵魂中听到了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.74,0:17:31.32,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,你对这女孩深沉长久的思念
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.57,0:17:34.78,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你在窥视别人的内心吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.14,0:17:37.16,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余也正是如此期望
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:38.99,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,因此没有什么好奇怪的
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.46,0:17:42.92,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,别碰我！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.38,0:17:46.88,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那么 我的目的已经达成了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.88,0:17:49.34,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,很开心哦 人类
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.43,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,克苏鲁…
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.55,0:17:56.81,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你在玩弄我和舞由的感情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.55,0:18:00.88,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.47,0:18:03.23,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,绝对要打倒你
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.30,0:18:06.69,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,就算你是什么邪神也无所谓
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.69,0:18:10.94,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,就算这具身体被粉碎直至原子
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.40,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,我也绝对会将你紧追不放
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.16,0:18:15.39,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,{\an3}直到把你杀死
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:17.62,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,就是这样！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.62,0:18:20.58,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,余最喜欢的就是你现在这副表情了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.58,0:18:22.54,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,今晚和你见面真是太好了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.29,0:18:24.63,Default,Cthulhu,0,0,0,,那就再会了
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.42,0:18:29.02,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,克苏鲁——！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.37,0:19:05.00,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,好像已经开始了啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.00,0:19:06.50,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,接下来就…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.50,0:19:09.25,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,梵蒂冈也真是会乱使唤人
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.06,0:19:17.26,Default,Joe,0,0,0,,多谢款待
Comment: 0,0:19:32.19,0:19:33.65,Default,System,0,0,0,,(理智检测,Sanity Check)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.19,0:19:33.65,Default,System,0,0,0,,理智检测
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.19,0:19:33.65,Ruby,System,0,0,0,,{\fs46\pos(960,992)}Sanity Check
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.68,0:19:36.75,Default,System,0,0,0,,OK
Comment: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:38.01,Default,System,0,0,0,,(准备完成,Standing by)
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:38.01,Default,System,0,0,0,,准备完成
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.75,0:19:38.01,Ruby,System,0,0,0,,{\fs46\pos(960,992)}Standing by
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.67,0:19:39.62,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,登录
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.15,0:19:44.54,Default,System,0,0,0,,COMPLETE
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.39,0:19:59.47,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,这里是…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.32,0:20:01.68,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,京都？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.68,0:20:05.39,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,没错 欢迎来到VR京都
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.39,0:20:09.85,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,圭小姐 之前和你在京都共度的一天很愉快哦
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.23,0:20:11.99,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,你还和她做了这种事吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.99,0:20:13.44,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,呃 没错…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.94,0:20:19.45,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,其实 上次旅行也是为了制作这个游戏的实地考察
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.45,0:20:22.28,Default,Cthugha,0,0,0,,请看我的自信之作吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.99,0:20:34.34,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,啊 存活至今的各位精英啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:38.34,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,那么 今天的是格亚大人所构思的塔防游戏！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:41.83,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,就是从不断进攻的敌人手中守住据点的那种吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.83,0:20:44.85,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,好像不需要动脑子 真不错 很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.85,0:20:46.72,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,这也不一定吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.72,0:20:48.35,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,那个 我有个问题
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.60,0:20:50.06,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,怎么了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.06,0:20:53.15,Default,Kei,0,0,0,,似乎少了一位玩家吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.15,0:20:54.90,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,确实啊
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.90,0:20:57.11,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,绝对不会有什么好事
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.11,0:21:00.56,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,啊 那个吗？ 实际上…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.62,0:21:04.95,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,瑛太选手放弃了这场游戏
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.37,Default,All,0,0,0,,哈？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.37,0:21:08.70,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,肯定是因为有复杂的内情吧
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.70,0:21:11.33,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,这游戏是有内情就能放弃的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.33,0:21:14.21,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,他也被舆论攻击得很厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.21,0:21:16.59,Default,Seishiro,0,0,0,,该不会是自杀了什么的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.80,0:21:22.76,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,这就不在我们的管辖范围之内了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.01,0:21:24.47,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你们这些家伙…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.47,0:21:27.10,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,综上所述 这次参加的有四名玩家
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.10,0:21:30.14,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,然后在开始前 有一件事必须通知你们
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.60,0:21:32.81,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,诶呀 到我出场了
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.61,0:21:37.48,Default,Hastur,0,0,0,,来吧…噬星的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.86,0:21:38.74,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,哈？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.74,0:21:40.19,Default,Kanna,0,0,0,,战士？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.12,0:21:48.08,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,今宵京都之月正渴望着鲜血
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.08,0:21:49.16,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,你是…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:50.63,DefaultTop,All,0,0,0,,瑛太君？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.16,0:21:50.63,Default,All,0,0,0,,瑛太？！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.63,0:21:52.75,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我不认识那个人类
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.75,0:21:55.00,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,我乃是赤红之凶星
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.00,0:21:56.46,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,噬星的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.46,0:21:57.88,Default,Eita,0,0,0,,毕宿五！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.71,0:22:01.92,Default,Miko,0,0,0,,瑛太！
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.92,0:22:05.05,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,新规则发布 这位是噬星的战士
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.05,0:22:09.89,Default,Tick Tock Man,0,0,0,,从这场游戏开始 他将作为邪神方的玩家与各位战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.14,0:22:11.60,Default,All,0,0,0,,哈？！
